    Time: 100.5
    Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 17532fc1fe5542f46a6829d6202d0689, type: 3}
    Channel: 2
    Emitter: {fileID: 3689503627835179758}
    Volume: 1
    Speaker: 2
    Subtitle: That's what everyone says.
